	$
	IFREF	SINH
/
/
/
/
/	S  I  N  H
/	-  -  -  -
/
/
/
/
/
/
/
/	COPYRIGHT 1971
/	DIGITAL EQUIPMENT CORPORATION
/	146 MAIN STREET,
/	MAYNARD, MASSACHUSSETTS.
/				01754
