/
/	THIS IS A PRETTY FEEBLE TANGENT ROUTINE FOR THE PRESENT.
/
/
/
TAN,	JA	.		/ENTRY FOR THE TANGENT.
	JEQ	TAN		/IF ZERO RETURN NOW.
	FSTA	MCRTP8		/SAVE FOR A SECOND.
	JSA	COS		/TAKE THE COSINE NOW.
	JEQ	TANER		/COS=0. A NO-NO
	FSTA	MCRTP7		/AND SAVE IT.
	FLDA	MCRTP8		/NOW TAKE THE SINE OF IT.
	JSA	SIN		/TAKE THE SINE NOW.
	FDIV	MCRTP7		/DO THE DIVISION.
	JA	TAN		/AND RETURN.
/
/
TANER,	TRAP7	10		/GIVE THE TRAP INSTRUCTION.
	JA	TAN		/AND RETURN.
