/
/
/	AMOD(X,Y)=X-INT(X/Y)*Y
/
/
AMOD,	JA	.		/ENTRY
	FSTA	MCRTP8		/SAVE IN A TEMPORARY.
	FDIV	MCRTP1		/DIVIDE BY Y
	JAL	AMODER		/TOO BIG.
	ALN	0		/FIX IT UP NOW.
